window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>“Lynsay Sands writes books that keep readers coming back for more.”<br> —Katie MacAlister, <i>USA Today Bestselling</i> Author of <i>A Girl’s Guide to Vampires</i></p><p><br>The Argeneau vampire family is back in <i>Born to Bite </i>by <i>USA Today</i> and <i>New York Times</i> bestseller Lynsay Sands. One of the<i> </i>premier names in contemporary paranormal romance, the incomparable Sands blends steamy passion with mystery, as a sexy, chopper-riding Enforcer investigates a breathtaking immortal whose previous three wives all have had trouble remaining undead. Are you hooked on Charlaine Harris and her Sookie Stackhouse books? Then Lynsay Sands and <i>Born to Bite </i>are exactly what you’re hungry for.</p>"; 
